    {
      "diff": "@@ -44,6 +44,31 @@ The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n // CVSS AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L\n // CWE-126\n \n+* null wsbuglink:19229[].\n+\n+* wssalink:2023-23[]\n+// Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n+// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n+// cveidlink:2023-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: xxx\n+// Fixed in release-4.0: xxx\n+// Fixed in release-3.6: xxx\n+// CVSS AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L\n+// CWE-126\n+* null wsbuglink:19258[].\n+\n+* wssalink:2023-23[]\n+// Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n+// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n+// cveidlink:2023-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: xxx\n+// Fixed in release-4.0: xxx\n+// Fixed in release-3.6: xxx\n+// CVSS AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L\n+// CWE-126\n+* null wsbuglink:19259[].\n+\n+\n The following bugs have been fixed:\n \n //* wsbuglink:5000[]\n@@ -51,6 +76,22 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark keeps banging out random chords on your piano and yelling “LIPS LIKE SUGUAR, SUGAR KISSES” because it was funny that one time at a party.\n \n+* Wireshark wrongly blames group membership when pcap capabilities are removed. wsbuglink:18279[].\n+\n+* Packet bytes window broken layout. wsbuglink:18326[].\n+\n+* Valid Ethernet CFM DMM packets are shown as malformed. wsbuglink:19198[].\n+\n+* The QUIC dissector is reporting the quic_transport_parameters max_ack_delay with the title \"GREASE\". wsbuglink:19209[].\n+\n+* Preferences: Folder name editing behaves weirdly, cursor jumps. wsbuglink:19213[].\n+\n+* DCHCPFO: Expert info list does not show all expert infos. wsbuglink:19216[].\n+\n+* Applying Color filtering fails when selecting the same field to color (i.e., changing frames without focusing in packet details). wsbuglink:19249[].\n+\n+* NAS 5GS Malformed Packet Decoding SOR transparent container PLMN ID and access technology list. wsbuglink:19273[].\n+\n \n === New and Updated Features\n \n@@ -65,9 +106,19 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v3.6.13.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v3.6.16.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+BT SDP\n+CP2179\n+CQL\n+DHCPFO\n+F1AP\n+GSM DTAP\n+IEEE 802.11\n+NAS-5GS\n+PFCP\n+TFTP\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
